WEBVTT

00:01.645 --> 00:02.982
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:03.006 --> 00:04.341
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.365 --> 00:07.581
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.605 --> 00:13.165
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.165 --> 01:31.125
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.285 --> 01:34.525
=Episode 13=

01:47.250 --> 01:48.250
Who is that?

01:48.750 --> 01:49.750
All right.

01:50.265 --> 01:51.265
Old fellow.

01:51.300 --> 01:53.105
Your hearing gets better!

01:54.400 --> 01:55.425
Old brother.

01:55.700 --> 01:56.681
It's you.

01:56.705 --> 01:57.705
Yeah, I'm here.

01:57.750 --> 01:59.081
It's the end of the year now.

01:59.105 --> 01:59.921
This government

01:59.945 --> 02:00.761
distributed

02:00.785 --> 02:01.345
some rice

02:01.575 --> 02:02.265
to us.

02:02.350 --> 02:03.801
I brought some here

02:03.825 --> 02:04.762
to surprise you.

02:04.786 --> 02:06.000
Well,

02:06.400 --> 02:07.801
I can escape your eyes,

02:07.825 --> 02:09.400
but I can't escape your ears.

02:10.900 --> 02:11.921
I was just

02:11.945 --> 02:13.851
talking about you with that boy.

02:13.875 --> 02:14.442
Um.

02:14.466 --> 02:16.041
If you came a little earlier,

02:16.065 --> 02:17.475
you would be able to meet him.

02:17.725 --> 02:18.325
Um.

02:18.475 --> 02:19.282
Old brother.

02:19.306 --> 02:20.761
You work in the government.

02:20.785 --> 02:22.276
Just give him a hand

02:22.300 --> 02:24.025
if you can.

02:24.350 --> 02:25.050
Well,

02:25.175 --> 02:27.200
he doesn't need my help.

02:28.450 --> 02:30.550
I beg you.

02:30.850 --> 02:31.921
Please.

02:31.945 --> 02:32.601
All right.

02:32.625 --> 02:33.625
Let's not talk about him.

02:34.275 --> 02:35.575
Well,

02:35.675 --> 02:36.705
it's the end of the year.

02:37.100 --> 02:38.305
Tell me

02:38.675 --> 02:40.505
if there is anything you want

02:40.975 --> 02:42.025
or you want to do.

02:42.150 --> 02:43.665
I have a regret,

02:43.750 --> 02:45.145
but you can't

02:45.275 --> 02:46.900
help me.

02:47.200 --> 02:48.200
Ah?

02:48.225 --> 02:49.225
Tell me about it.

02:49.425 --> 02:50.665
My only regret

02:50.900 --> 02:52.225
in this life

02:52.300 --> 02:54.225
is that I didn't
take a look at General Xu.

02:55.350 --> 02:57.945
At first, the cavalry
only had 600 soldiers.

02:58.000 --> 02:59.745
Now the world is at peace.

02:59.975 --> 03:01.651
I didn't even have a word

03:01.675 --> 03:03.825
with General Xu.

03:04.250 --> 03:06.625
What a pity is that!

03:07.450 --> 03:08.905
Xu Xiao

03:09.050 --> 03:11.950
is an old man with a white beard now.

03:12.825 --> 03:15.626
Don't call General Xu by his name!

03:15.650 --> 03:16.176
All right.

03:16.200 --> 03:16.961
Don't get excited.

03:16.985 --> 03:17.602
What's there to be mad about?

03:17.626 --> 03:18.641
Come on. Sit down.

03:18.665 --> 03:19.665
Sit down first.

03:32.700 --> 03:35.450
The cavalryman of the lowest rank

03:35.675 --> 03:36.900
from the 18th Laozi Battalion

03:37.400 --> 03:39.025
and Yugu Battalion

03:40.050 --> 03:41.325
of Jinzhou

03:41.825 --> 03:43.305
greets General Xu.

03:45.800 --> 03:47.251
Why are you so sure

03:47.275 --> 03:48.385
that I'm Xu Xiao?

03:49.100 --> 03:51.450
After the battle
where I got my eyes hurt,

03:51.745 --> 03:53.675
you came to see the wounded.

03:53.975 --> 03:55.250
You held my hand

03:55.325 --> 03:56.400
and told me

03:57.075 --> 03:59.185
that I must stay alive.

04:00.475 --> 04:02.665
Although I couldn't see,

04:03.125 --> 04:04.825
I've remembered

04:05.575 --> 04:07.785
your hands for a lifetime.

04:09.700 --> 04:10.641
Old brother, get up.

04:10.665 --> 04:11.665
Come on.

04:11.825 --> 04:12.825
Come on.

04:12.925 --> 04:13.925
Sit down.

04:19.625 --> 04:20.705
General Xu.

04:21.850 --> 04:23.465
If you don't mind me asking,

04:23.900 --> 04:25.881
is that boy Xu your...?

04:25.905 --> 04:26.905
He's my son.

04:27.275 --> 04:28.275
Xu Fengnian.

04:31.225 --> 04:33.065
Congratulations to General Xu.

04:33.450 --> 04:34.825
You and the Consort

04:35.175 --> 04:37.225
gave birth to a good son.

04:37.700 --> 04:38.785
I'm content with

04:39.800 --> 04:40.905
my life now.

04:42.925 --> 04:44.865
I have no regrets anymore.

04:45.725 --> 04:46.800
General Xu.

04:47.000 --> 04:48.505
I have one more question.

04:50.450 --> 04:52.525
How many of those old brothers

04:54.050 --> 04:55.945
are still alive?

05:14.675 --> 05:16.441
As long as the flag
of the army of North Liang

05:16.465 --> 05:18.300
doesn't fall,

05:20.675 --> 05:22.185
they are still there.

05:24.225 --> 05:25.950
Then I'll tell them

05:27.725 --> 05:28.825
that there is an inheritor

05:29.600 --> 05:30.825
of North Liang.

05:32.250 --> 05:33.550
This flag

05:34.825 --> 05:36.465
will never fall.

05:56.000 --> 05:57.700
Are you still reading on New Year's Eve?

06:01.375 --> 06:02.535
The new year will come anyway

06:02.950 --> 06:03.985
no matter what you do.

06:04.500 --> 06:05.985
It's such a happy day.

06:06.400 --> 06:07.785
Don't be so philosophical.

06:12.700 --> 06:13.825
Where's Grandpa Wei?

06:14.650 --> 06:16.010
He's sleeping on the second floor.

06:16.650 --> 06:17.665
Good.

06:20.325 --> 06:21.325
Let's drink.

06:30.800 --> 06:33.300
In previous years, I could see
snow scenes during the New Year.

06:33.575 --> 06:34.775
This year,

06:35.650 --> 06:37.505
I can only have some wine.

06:37.975 --> 06:38.975
Come on.

06:52.075 --> 06:53.795
How do you spend the New Year
in North Mang?

06:56.800 --> 06:57.875
Where there are people,

06:58.100 --> 06:59.220
it's all basically the same.

07:02.150 --> 07:04.850
The same people spend the same New Year.

07:05.900 --> 07:08.800
But they have to
fight with each other to death.

07:18.300 --> 07:19.665
People and people fight.

07:20.225 --> 07:21.625
Village and village fight.

07:22.350 --> 07:23.725
Town and town fight.

07:24.100 --> 07:26.705
How can the state be an exception?

07:30.900 --> 07:31.945
Well said.

07:38.125 --> 07:42.150
♪ The millions of people in North Liang ♪

07:42.275 --> 07:46.926
♪ How many of them end up dead in armor ♪

07:46.950 --> 07:47.722
Listen.

07:47.746 --> 07:50.576
♪ Drink down feat and fame ♪

07:50.600 --> 07:52.945
It's the Requiem for the Phantom
of North Liang.

07:53.350 --> 07:54.676
My second sister wrote the lyrics.

07:54.700 --> 07:55.900
I composed the music.

07:57.025 --> 07:58.081
At the end of each year,

07:58.105 --> 07:59.761
more than 30 musicians

07:59.785 --> 08:01.201
and 160 dancers

08:01.225 --> 08:03.625
play music and dance in the city.

08:04.525 --> 08:05.885
If you go out now,

08:06.225 --> 08:08.945
you can see the lights
brighten the night.

08:09.850 --> 08:11.926
♪ The earth mixed with snow
and the hot stove ♪

08:11.950 --> 08:12.961
I'll just listen.

08:12.985 --> 08:16.475
♪ The white hands and the slim waist ♪

08:16.525 --> 08:20.975
♪ One hundred thousand crossbows ♪

08:21.325 --> 08:24.826
♪ Almost cover the sky ♪

08:24.850 --> 08:25.850
The lyrics are good,

08:27.200 --> 08:28.201
but the music is normal.

08:28.225 --> 08:30.225
♪ Millions of fellows ♪

08:30.800 --> 08:35.932
♪ Can't see the way back home ♪

08:35.956 --> 08:37.516
That's also what my second sister said.

08:38.025 --> 08:39.461
Maybe you two will get along.

08:39.485 --> 08:47.485
♪ Don't say
that all heroes fall into a trap ♪

08:47.650 --> 08:49.051
♪ Young ladies ♪

08:49.075 --> 08:51.401
♪ Don't hide your feelings of love ♪

08:51.425 --> 08:52.481
I heard that you are going
to leave again.

08:52.505 --> 08:53.545
Yes.

08:54.275 --> 08:55.525
I'll go to Wudi City.

08:57.000 --> 08:58.384
♪ Come come come ♪

08:58.408 --> 09:01.675
♪ Who is playing the Beauty Drum ♪

09:01.875 --> 09:03.451
♪ Come come come ♪

09:03.475 --> 09:06.650
♪ Who is mending the sky with one hand ♪

09:06.675 --> 09:08.226
♪ Come come come ♪

09:08.250 --> 09:16.250
♪ Who will compete with me ♪

09:16.625 --> 09:17.625
I lend them to you.

09:18.050 --> 09:19.065
I'll need them back.

09:26.975 --> 09:28.345
Both of them?

09:31.375 --> 09:32.375
All right.

09:32.700 --> 09:33.985
It's worth it to drink with you.

09:35.375 --> 09:40.000
♪ One hundred thousand crossbows ♪

09:40.375 --> 09:45.025
♪ Almost cover the sky ♪

09:45.075 --> 09:49.851
♪ Millions of fellows ♪

09:49.875 --> 09:56.950
♪ Can't see the way back home ♪

09:57.000 --> 09:58.551
♪ Good men ♪

09:58.575 --> 10:06.575
♪ Don't say
that all heroes fall into a trap ♪

10:06.650 --> 10:08.226
♪ Young ladies ♪

10:08.250 --> 10:16.100
♪ Don't hide your feelings of love ♪

10:16.150 --> 10:17.876
♪ Come come come ♪

10:17.900 --> 10:20.976
♪ Who is playing the Beauty Drum ♪

10:21.000 --> 10:22.676
♪ Come come come ♪

10:22.700 --> 10:25.725
♪ Who is mending the sky with one hand ♪

10:25.875 --> 10:27.376
♪ Come come come ♪

10:27.400 --> 10:35.400
♪ Who will compete with me ♪

10:44.450 --> 10:46.105
The moods get depressed

10:46.625 --> 10:48.545
when I drink alone.

10:51.900 --> 10:53.175
I'll find someone else.

11:05.925 --> 11:07.050
Thank you.

11:30.725 --> 11:33.105
You are not from here.

11:34.900 --> 11:35.925
A book stealer!

11:40.750 --> 11:41.785
Do you want wine?

11:50.125 --> 11:51.225
Save me a mouthful.

11:55.650 --> 11:57.640
You really saved me a mouthful.

12:01.175 --> 12:02.600
Listen.

12:03.475 --> 12:05.505
These are not secret scriptures.

12:06.625 --> 12:08.700
The secret scriptures are up there.

12:10.400 --> 12:11.002
Let's go.

12:11.026 --> 12:12.106
I'll take you to find them.

12:12.550 --> 12:13.550
Come on.

12:13.665 --> 12:14.945
Let's go.

12:15.975 --> 12:17.385
Be gentle.

12:17.500 --> 12:18.905
White Fox is sleeping.

12:18.945 --> 12:20.500
Don't wake her up.

12:21.625 --> 12:22.785
And also,

12:23.375 --> 12:24.726
you don't take...

12:24.750 --> 12:25.751
Don't take secret scriptures.

12:25.775 --> 12:27.175
Secret scriptures are hard to sell.

12:27.475 --> 12:31.305
The antiques and precious stones
are on the fourth floor.

12:31.775 --> 12:32.815
Those things are valuable.

12:37.150 --> 12:39.125
I mean, White Fox is sleeping.

12:39.175 --> 12:41.025
Should I stay by her side?

12:43.375 --> 12:44.415
You have a point.

12:44.725 --> 12:46.145
I need to watch her.

12:47.050 --> 12:49.545
Don't let her throw up on my clothes.

12:51.300 --> 12:52.465
I'm leaving.

12:52.700 --> 12:53.521
Don't take too much.

12:53.545 --> 12:54.545
Don't be too greedy.

12:56.000 --> 12:57.985
It's hard to believe
you are Xu Xiao's son.

12:58.425 --> 12:59.675
Interesting.

13:00.065 --> 13:01.225
What did you say?

13:26.500 --> 13:27.785
What are you doing?

13:28.350 --> 13:29.350
You're awake.

13:41.575 --> 13:42.401
Since you are awake,

13:42.425 --> 13:43.425
I'll go back.

13:50.650 --> 13:51.930
Do you need me to send you back?

13:52.775 --> 13:53.775
No need.

13:54.675 --> 13:59.225
No matter how drunk I am,

14:00.025 --> 14:01.600
I can still find

14:01.900 --> 14:03.665
my way back home.

14:32.100 --> 14:33.745
Xu Fengnian!

14:40.850 --> 14:42.761
What are you doing in my room?

14:42.785 --> 14:44.350
This is my room!

14:49.100 --> 14:50.425
It's okay.

14:50.625 --> 14:52.841
I got drunk last night

14:52.865 --> 14:54.025
and went into the wrong room.

14:54.600 --> 14:56.001
Don't worry.

14:56.025 --> 14:58.121
I'll explain it to everyone.

14:58.145 --> 14:59.265
Don't say anything!

14:59.650 --> 15:00.350
Ah?

15:00.465 --> 15:01.926
Don't say anything.

15:01.950 --> 15:03.551
I'll tell everyone it's me...

15:03.575 --> 15:04.575
Get out!

15:05.025 --> 15:06.721
You are too loud.

15:06.745 --> 15:08.105
They must have heard you.

15:10.600 --> 15:11.721
Don't you need me to explain it?

15:11.745 --> 15:13.226
- Get out now!
- Let me

15:13.250 --> 15:14.665
put on my shoes.

15:32.225 --> 15:34.576
(The following spring)

15:34.600 --> 15:37.250
(Mansion of Lord of North Liang)

15:40.300 --> 15:40.985
My Lord.

15:41.250 --> 15:42.250
Everything is ready.

15:42.300 --> 15:43.475
We can leave anytime.

15:47.650 --> 15:49.105
As you required,

15:49.325 --> 15:50.325
Ning Emei

15:50.500 --> 15:51.500
will lead

15:51.675 --> 15:53.801
a cavalry of 100 soldiers
of Fengzi Battalion

15:53.825 --> 15:54.945
to go with you.

15:55.600 --> 15:56.865
You will see them

15:57.050 --> 15:58.345
after you set off.

16:00.700 --> 16:01.700
Qingniao

16:01.950 --> 16:03.230
will drive the carriage for you.

16:04.325 --> 16:05.725
From now on,

16:05.775 --> 16:07.300
you have to keep it in mind

16:07.425 --> 16:09.375
every word I said.

16:17.125 --> 16:17.756
My Lord.

16:17.780 --> 16:18.361
- Your Highness.
- Um.

16:18.385 --> 16:19.385
Wei Shuyang.

16:20.875 --> 16:21.600
My Lord.

16:21.725 --> 16:22.602
Wei Shuyang

16:22.626 --> 16:23.801
is learned and capable,

16:23.825 --> 16:26.075
especially in terms of

16:26.200 --> 16:27.200
martial arts.

16:27.650 --> 16:28.681
You should

16:28.705 --> 16:30.065
rely on him more.

16:31.225 --> 16:32.505
Grandpa Wei, thank you.

16:32.750 --> 16:34.185
Your Highness, you're welcome.

16:35.050 --> 16:37.200
Her name is Shu Xiu.

16:37.400 --> 16:38.545
You met her before.

16:39.025 --> 16:40.025
She knows

16:40.075 --> 16:42.175
how the world of martial arts works.

16:42.300 --> 16:43.870
You can ask her

16:43.975 --> 16:45.455
in case of any special circumstances.

16:46.200 --> 16:47.725
You can ask me anything.

16:53.300 --> 16:54.525
Be careful.

16:54.800 --> 16:55.800
Um.

16:56.800 --> 16:58.525
Why is there no one by that carriage?

16:58.950 --> 17:00.505
The carriage driver will come soon.

17:05.325 --> 17:06.905
What are you doing inside?

17:08.025 --> 17:09.121
I'll stay with Jiang Ni

17:09.145 --> 17:09.852
no matter where she goes.

17:09.876 --> 17:10.921
That's absurd!

17:10.945 --> 17:12.450
Jiang Ni won't come with me.

17:21.275 --> 17:22.315
You are...

17:23.950 --> 17:25.450
Which carriage will take me?

17:25.975 --> 17:26.975
This one!

17:29.975 --> 17:31.025
You planned this?

17:31.525 --> 17:32.525
Yes.

17:32.625 --> 17:33.641
I'm leaving for
the world of martial arts.

17:33.665 --> 17:34.745
Why should I take Jiang Ni?

17:35.075 --> 17:36.051
You need

17:36.075 --> 17:36.762
someone

17:36.786 --> 17:38.625
to take care of you

17:38.850 --> 17:40.745
on the road.

17:41.100 --> 17:42.081
There are so many maids.

17:42.105 --> 17:43.925
Why did you pick Jiang Ni?

17:44.850 --> 17:46.825
If you leave Jiang Ni in the mansion,

17:47.025 --> 17:49.025
what if

17:49.150 --> 17:50.426
your second sister's subordinates

17:50.450 --> 17:51.450
try to hurt her again?

17:51.625 --> 17:52.975
That's the only reason?

17:57.800 --> 17:59.225
I have to bother you

17:59.575 --> 18:00.575
to take care of Fengnian

18:01.025 --> 18:02.305
during this trip!

18:04.700 --> 18:05.362
Hey!

18:05.386 --> 18:06.425
Don't smear my carriage!

18:07.475 --> 18:09.050
Who is that person?

18:10.225 --> 18:11.075
The monster

18:11.200 --> 18:13.175
who was locked
under the Tingchao Pavilion.

18:14.100 --> 18:15.100
By the way,

18:15.525 --> 18:17.125
there is one thing
you must keep in mind.

18:17.275 --> 18:18.985
Never give him a sword.

18:19.500 --> 18:20.425
What kind of sword?

18:20.465 --> 18:21.505
All kinds of swords.

18:21.700 --> 18:22.681
What about a wooden sword?

18:22.705 --> 18:23.850
Not even a wooden sword!

18:24.150 --> 18:25.665
Give him a name at least.

18:27.450 --> 18:28.150
Eh.

18:28.300 --> 18:30.265
The other carriage driver is here.

18:30.575 --> 18:31.775
Great Sword,

18:32.000 --> 18:33.300
Lyu Qiantang.

18:37.075 --> 18:38.601
You're not Lyu Qiantang!

18:38.625 --> 18:39.282
Aren't you Lin

18:39.306 --> 18:40.465
who tried to assassinate me?

18:41.500 --> 18:42.321
I'm Lyu Qiantang.

18:42.345 --> 18:43.225
Greetings to Your Highness.

18:43.350 --> 18:44.601
Your voice doesn't even change!

18:44.625 --> 18:45.521
Don't you lie to me!

18:45.545 --> 18:46.401
(Lyu Qiantang, retainer)
I'm Lyu Qiantang.

18:46.425 --> 18:47.776
(Lyu Qiantang, retainer)
Greetings to Your Highness.

18:47.800 --> 18:48.985
What is going on now?

18:49.950 --> 18:52.100
Your first stop is Qingzhou.

18:52.200 --> 18:53.281
The Lin family in Qingzhou

18:53.305 --> 18:55.241
has been cornered
by the Lord of Jing'an.

18:55.265 --> 18:56.905
It will do you no harm

18:57.075 --> 18:58.425
to let him come with you.

18:59.950 --> 19:01.665
You forced him to yield?

19:02.400 --> 19:04.265
He must yield

19:04.475 --> 19:05.875
if he wants to save the Lin family.

19:13.375 --> 19:14.665
A centipede does not topple over

19:15.050 --> 19:16.210
even when dead.

19:16.950 --> 19:18.675
The Lin family is still lingering on

19:19.150 --> 19:20.425
in Qingzhou.

19:21.375 --> 19:23.050
If you don't want it to perish,

19:23.925 --> 19:24.921
don't forget

19:24.945 --> 19:26.545
what I told you.

19:29.000 --> 19:30.000
Yes.

19:35.050 --> 19:36.550
How many things have you planned?

19:37.600 --> 19:38.625
Don't worry.

19:39.100 --> 19:40.345
With that old man by your side,

19:40.725 --> 19:42.265
even the world is turned upside down,

19:42.500 --> 19:44.385
he will keep you safe.

19:44.800 --> 19:46.385
Who is that old man?

19:47.175 --> 19:48.281
He will tell you

19:48.305 --> 19:49.625
when he wants.

19:50.675 --> 19:51.785
After you leave,

19:51.900 --> 19:53.165
I will head for the capital.

19:53.825 --> 19:56.385
I'll be in the court, and you'll be
in the world of martial arts.

19:56.425 --> 19:58.126
Only we join forces,

19:58.150 --> 20:01.865
can we preserve
the hereditary system in North Liang.

20:02.850 --> 20:03.850
Um.

20:04.800 --> 20:06.025
Be careful on the road.

20:07.975 --> 20:08.975
Go now.

20:28.500 --> 20:30.825
How much more
have you planned along the way?

20:33.800 --> 20:35.075
We hit the road

20:35.625 --> 20:37.105
and embrace whatever comes.

20:40.375 --> 20:41.375
Set off.

21:27.425 --> 21:28.785
You got a letter from North Liang?

21:29.825 --> 21:30.921
What happened?

21:30.945 --> 21:32.025
None of your business.

21:32.200 --> 21:33.475
Don't say that.

21:33.850 --> 21:34.945
You and I

21:35.325 --> 21:36.565
will be a family one day.

21:37.000 --> 21:39.025
Your business is my business.

21:41.675 --> 21:42.675
Hongchi?

21:43.150 --> 21:44.665
You have the ancient sword.

21:45.850 --> 21:46.850
Get away.

21:47.100 --> 21:48.375
It's human nature

21:48.625 --> 21:49.985
for men and women to fall in love.

21:50.250 --> 21:51.241
I'm the only one

21:51.265 --> 21:52.785
who is good enough for you

21:52.900 --> 21:53.945
in Shangyin Academy.

21:54.550 --> 21:55.550
Eh?

21:55.675 --> 21:57.105
You should think about it.

22:22.450 --> 22:23.675
Why are you here in person?

22:23.975 --> 22:25.850
Xu Fengnian
is going to leave North Liang.

22:26.125 --> 22:27.125
Oh?

22:27.200 --> 22:29.476
Didn't he just go back
from a three-year tour?

22:29.500 --> 22:31.625
It's not secretive this time.

22:32.200 --> 22:33.750
He is traceable.

22:33.850 --> 22:35.100
He is bold indeed.

22:36.975 --> 22:38.025
But,

22:38.750 --> 22:41.076
what does it have to do with me
that he's gonna leave North Liang?

22:41.100 --> 22:42.105
Kill him.

22:42.450 --> 22:43.665
Is it the order of the court?

22:45.075 --> 22:46.075
No.

22:46.350 --> 22:47.390
Master.

22:47.925 --> 22:49.850
I have no grievances against him,

22:50.650 --> 22:51.705
and he might become

22:51.900 --> 22:54.065
my brother-in-law one day.

22:54.500 --> 22:55.745
If I kill him,

22:56.145 --> 22:57.425
what's in it for me?

22:57.475 --> 22:58.475
If he dies,

22:58.775 --> 23:00.185
North Liang will be in chaos,

23:00.675 --> 23:02.715
and the world will be in chaos.

23:03.250 --> 23:04.705
Only when the world is in chaos,

23:05.225 --> 23:07.345
can you have a chance to stand out.

23:11.450 --> 23:12.665
In this case,

23:12.775 --> 23:13.945
it's kind of interesting

23:16.900 --> 23:17.985
to kill my brother-in-law.

23:19.050 --> 23:20.225
Without the imperial order,

23:21.000 --> 23:22.945
I can't do it myself.

23:23.300 --> 23:25.505
I can only give you some helpers.

23:25.625 --> 23:27.500
(Han Diaosi, the Eunuch Chief of Liyang)

23:34.300 --> 23:35.921
The Fengzi Battalion's cavalry
of 100 soldiers

23:35.945 --> 23:37.345
is waiting ahead.

23:39.525 --> 23:40.985
I thought you would leave me

23:41.025 --> 23:41.722
and head for Mount Longhu

23:41.746 --> 23:43.125
once you are outside Lingzhou.

23:44.700 --> 23:46.100
The military order has been issued.

23:46.300 --> 23:48.220
The Fengzi Battalion
will escort you to the east.

23:48.600 --> 23:50.265
You just escort me

23:50.550 --> 23:51.550
when the order says so?

23:51.850 --> 23:52.850
Of course.

23:53.000 --> 23:54.161
Orders are orders.

23:54.185 --> 23:56.121
Aren't you going
to get Huangman'er back?

23:56.145 --> 23:57.401
That's not on the military order.

23:57.425 --> 23:58.002
After we get to Mount Longhu,

23:58.026 --> 23:59.225
I'll leave the team

23:59.545 --> 24:01.265
and rescue Young Master Longxiang
on my own.

24:02.075 --> 24:03.042
Is the cavalry of Fengzi Battalion

24:03.066 --> 24:04.401
waiting ahead on the main road?

24:04.425 --> 24:05.441
Not on the main road.

24:05.465 --> 24:06.481
They are waiting in the woods.

24:06.505 --> 24:07.162
Why?

24:07.186 --> 24:08.386
To avoid disturbing the people

24:08.575 --> 24:09.945
when there is no military order.

24:10.100 --> 24:11.042
Don't you know it?

24:11.066 --> 24:12.681
Then I have to trouble you

24:12.705 --> 24:14.025
to bring them here.

24:21.200 --> 24:22.625
Please stay, Your Highness.

24:38.075 --> 24:39.600
Iron Cavalry.

24:39.850 --> 24:40.945
You are Dian Xiongchu.

24:41.500 --> 24:43.226
(Dian Xiongchu, General of Iron Cavalry)
Please wait a moment, Your Highness.

24:43.250 --> 24:45.505
Our general wants
to see you off in person.

24:45.700 --> 24:47.665
I remember you are
Chen Zhibao's subordinate.

24:48.100 --> 24:50.401
Please wait at your ease.

24:50.425 --> 24:52.225
What if I don't want to wait?

25:06.600 --> 25:07.701
You didn't even tell me

25:07.725 --> 25:08.850
that you are leaving.

25:09.200 --> 25:11.076
I'm willing to be at your service,

25:11.100 --> 25:13.500
holding your whip and following
your stirrups, Your Highness.

25:14.425 --> 25:15.475
Dian.

25:16.100 --> 25:17.100
Make way.

25:17.325 --> 25:18.325
General Chu.

25:18.900 --> 25:20.000
I don't think your crossbow

25:20.185 --> 25:22.601
can't shoot through the iron armor
of the Iron Cavalry.

25:22.625 --> 25:23.865
Do you wanna try it?

25:49.175 --> 25:50.305
Young Master Xu is leaving.

25:50.425 --> 25:51.640
Iron Cavalry, make way now!

25:51.700 --> 25:53.500
General Chen asked
Young Master Xu to wait.

25:54.350 --> 25:56.030
The title of the army
of North Liang is Xu,

25:56.250 --> 25:57.250
not Chen.

25:57.750 --> 25:58.750
General Ning.

25:58.875 --> 26:01.321
Are you really willing to serve him?

26:01.345 --> 26:02.500
I'm asking you to make way.

26:03.250 --> 26:04.401
You can try to charge

26:04.425 --> 26:05.322
if you dare.

26:05.346 --> 26:06.681
Are you done?

26:06.705 --> 26:09.025
Who can afford the charge
of infighting within North Liang?

26:09.450 --> 26:11.345
I'll give you one last chance.

26:11.600 --> 26:12.600
Make way.

26:13.900 --> 26:14.925
Get ready to charge!

26:15.550 --> 26:16.665
Raise your bow!

26:21.700 --> 26:23.545
Aren't you supposed
to protect Xu Fengnian?

26:23.650 --> 26:24.721
I'll go out

26:24.745 --> 26:25.750
when he is dying.

26:26.125 --> 26:28.081
There are battle-hardened
elite soldiers out there.

26:28.105 --> 26:30.225
How many can you stop by yourself?

26:30.400 --> 26:31.576
Thousands of soldiers

26:31.600 --> 26:33.545
are just easy prey to me.

26:33.725 --> 26:35.545
Everyone can brag.

26:51.025 --> 26:52.281
Chen Zhibao.

26:52.305 --> 26:53.851
Be careful.

26:53.875 --> 26:55.521
Don't you know

26:55.545 --> 26:57.625
what will happen if one of my men
releases the arrow?

26:58.345 --> 26:59.481
I just left Lingzhou

26:59.505 --> 27:00.651
and you caught up with me in a hurry.

27:00.675 --> 27:02.351
Are you so eager to kill me?

27:02.375 --> 27:03.375
Dian Xiongchu!

27:03.925 --> 27:04.925
General.

27:06.000 --> 27:07.705
Dian Xiongchu can escort you
to the east.

27:08.650 --> 27:10.025
I don't think

27:10.875 --> 27:12.150
we are that close.

27:12.400 --> 27:13.665
You can't die now

27:14.125 --> 27:15.681
for North Liang's sake.

27:15.705 --> 27:17.025
Why don't you die first

27:17.400 --> 27:18.865
for North Liang's sake?

27:19.025 --> 27:20.161
It's none of your business.

27:20.185 --> 27:21.201
Young Master Xu's business

27:21.225 --> 27:21.881
is my business.

27:21.905 --> 27:22.905
Stop fighting.

27:23.875 --> 27:25.625
I refuse to leave with Iron Cavalry.

27:26.300 --> 27:28.145
Ning Emei's Fengzi Battalion is enough.

27:28.975 --> 27:30.385
He always hates you.

27:30.675 --> 27:32.035
I don't think he will try his best

27:32.375 --> 27:34.075
to protect you.

27:34.575 --> 27:35.905
Well, do you and Dian Xiongchu

27:35.945 --> 27:37.225
appreciate me?

27:37.425 --> 27:38.465
With my order,

27:38.650 --> 27:40.250
Dian Xiongchu will use his life

27:40.450 --> 27:41.450
to protect you.

27:41.575 --> 27:42.700
No need.

27:43.000 --> 27:44.225
Think it through.

27:44.275 --> 27:45.400
It's not safe

27:45.675 --> 27:46.725
to leave North Liang.

27:50.375 --> 27:51.145
Ning Emei.

27:51.250 --> 27:51.922
Yes!

27:51.946 --> 27:53.401
Before we get to Mount Longhu,

27:53.425 --> 27:54.945
can you protect my life?

27:55.025 --> 27:56.305
With the military order,

27:56.500 --> 27:58.101
as long as there is one soldier alive
in Fengzi Battalion,

27:58.125 --> 27:59.525
you will be fine.

28:00.125 --> 28:01.375
Compared with you,

28:01.825 --> 28:03.325
I trust him more.

28:05.550 --> 28:07.025
Iron Cavalry. Return to the camp.

28:14.175 --> 28:15.495
The heavily armored cavalry left.

28:21.175 --> 28:22.550
Are you worried about that boy?

28:23.775 --> 28:24.950
Who is worried about him?

28:25.650 --> 28:27.125
I'm worried about myself.

28:27.475 --> 28:29.121
If the cavalry starts to fight,

28:29.145 --> 28:30.481
you will protect Xu Fengnian.

28:30.505 --> 28:31.505
What about me?

28:36.825 --> 28:39.345
I've decided to take over North Liang.

28:40.375 --> 28:41.376
You are not qualified.

28:41.400 --> 28:42.282
I leave this time

28:42.306 --> 28:45.025
to win myself the heirship.

28:45.325 --> 28:46.575
None of this matters.

28:46.825 --> 28:47.875
You must have three things

28:47.975 --> 28:49.051
before you take over North Liang.

28:49.075 --> 28:49.825
One,

28:50.075 --> 28:50.785
a cruel heart.

28:50.975 --> 28:51.600
Two,

28:51.650 --> 28:52.650
a scheming mind.

28:52.775 --> 28:53.486
Three,

28:53.510 --> 28:54.510
connections.

28:54.850 --> 28:55.850
You are not good enough

28:56.950 --> 28:58.025
at any of them.

28:58.200 --> 29:00.425
That's basically what Xu Xiao said.

29:00.925 --> 29:02.425
Can there be something new?

29:08.875 --> 29:09.875
What about you?

29:10.375 --> 29:12.145
Are you good enough at
these three things?

29:30.275 --> 29:31.375
He is alone.

29:31.550 --> 29:32.745
How about we...

29:33.150 --> 29:34.865
I kind of appreciate him.

29:35.400 --> 29:36.761
There is something about that guy.

29:36.785 --> 29:38.175
That's why you can't keep him.

29:38.325 --> 29:39.325
Don't mess around.

29:39.850 --> 29:40.875
Your Highness.

29:41.000 --> 29:42.801
You shouldn't have told him

29:42.825 --> 29:43.825
about the heirship.

29:43.900 --> 29:45.701
You can't hide things like that.

29:45.725 --> 29:46.775
Telling it now

29:46.825 --> 29:47.642
can help North Liang

29:47.666 --> 29:48.705
and the capital

29:49.225 --> 29:50.665
prepare in advance.

29:50.750 --> 29:51.750
Go back.

29:52.900 --> 29:55.400
I'll escort you to leave North Liang.

29:56.000 --> 29:57.201
Xu Xiao will leave for the capital soon.

29:57.225 --> 29:58.361
You can protect him at that time.

29:58.385 --> 29:59.385
Really?

29:59.450 --> 30:00.450
It's settled.

30:00.825 --> 30:01.825
I got it.

30:02.275 --> 30:03.650
Be careful, Your Highness.

30:13.575 --> 30:14.575
Let's set off.

30:49.800 --> 30:50.800
What are you looking at?

30:51.825 --> 30:53.241
You have good qualifications.

30:53.265 --> 30:55.065
Do you want to learn
something useful from me?

30:56.950 --> 30:57.665
No.

30:57.800 --> 30:58.950
Why not?

30:59.325 --> 31:00.441
The fools

31:00.465 --> 31:01.601
who wanted to be my apprentices before

31:01.625 --> 31:03.625
could line up for North Liang
to the East Sea.

31:04.675 --> 31:07.050
Only fools wanted
to be your apprentices?

31:08.950 --> 31:10.275
Do you know who I am?

31:12.575 --> 31:13.625
Why should I care?

31:15.825 --> 31:16.925
You have a point.

31:19.600 --> 31:21.001
I almost forgot

31:21.025 --> 31:22.175
who I am.

31:22.700 --> 31:25.325
Who else would remember Mumaniu?

32:03.750 --> 32:05.525
This one is really big...

32:06.550 --> 32:09.025
You finally got one!
But you let it escape!

32:38.325 --> 32:40.025
You tried to kill me
last time when we met.

32:41.000 --> 32:42.305
Now you are my guard.

32:43.500 --> 32:44.725
You'll get used to it.

32:48.550 --> 32:50.250
I remember
it wasn't this sword last time.

32:51.875 --> 32:52.721
This sword

32:52.745 --> 32:53.625
is called Chixia.

32:53.750 --> 32:55.025
Grand Commander gave it to me.

32:56.775 --> 32:58.065
You are a scholar.

32:59.300 --> 33:00.825
Scholars can also use swords.

33:00.975 --> 33:02.505
Scholars are unpredictable.

33:02.625 --> 33:03.865
Maybe you will

33:04.525 --> 33:06.025
stab me with a sword again one day.

33:06.200 --> 33:07.441
Only when you are alive,

33:07.465 --> 33:09.041
Grand Commander will give my family

33:09.065 --> 33:10.345
the last chance to live.

33:19.250 --> 33:20.550
How is the Lin family now?

33:29.025 --> 33:31.145
The mansion has been ransacked
by the Lord of Jing'an.

33:39.500 --> 33:41.600
Then you should beg the Lord of Jing'an.

33:41.900 --> 33:43.525
What's the use to turn to Xu Xiao?

33:54.300 --> 33:57.050
You don't know
how horrible your father is.

34:05.500 --> 34:07.265
Even he changed his name,

34:07.650 --> 34:09.050
his surname will always be Lin.

34:10.850 --> 34:11.930
What are you trying to say?

34:12.150 --> 34:13.665
There is a danger

34:14.425 --> 34:15.945
of keeping such a person by your side.

34:16.900 --> 34:18.225
I have looked into his eyes.

34:18.650 --> 34:20.145
He can even give up his life.

34:20.500 --> 34:22.121
It won't do any difference
whether I kill him or not.

34:22.145 --> 34:23.145
He is dead inside.

34:25.500 --> 34:26.850
I'll keep an eye on him

34:27.400 --> 34:28.785
for you, Your Highness.

34:36.325 --> 34:37.251
Your Highness.

34:37.275 --> 34:38.275
Why don't you go inside?

34:38.825 --> 34:40.105
I'll keep watch before midnight.

34:40.375 --> 34:41.275
No need.

34:41.350 --> 34:42.601
The Fengzi Battalion camped near us.

34:42.625 --> 34:43.625
It's safe.

34:43.750 --> 34:44.502
It's better not

34:44.526 --> 34:46.725
to trust others with our lives.

34:47.250 --> 34:48.810
Who will guard here after the midnight?

34:53.975 --> 34:54.975
Um.

35:11.025 --> 35:12.465
We have left Lingzhou.

35:13.350 --> 35:14.350
I know.

35:14.575 --> 35:16.385
Now that we are out of North Liang,

35:17.225 --> 35:18.800
we have a chance now.

35:19.675 --> 35:20.725
What chance?

35:21.025 --> 35:22.250
To run away.

35:24.950 --> 35:25.950
Where?

35:26.225 --> 35:28.265
Anywhere is better than here.

35:29.850 --> 35:31.000
Have you ever thought about

35:31.300 --> 35:32.905
why Xu Xiao picked you

35:33.150 --> 35:35.545
to follow Xu Fengnian in this trip?

35:36.850 --> 35:38.775
What's the worst that can happen to you?

35:39.625 --> 35:40.625
I die.

35:41.300 --> 35:42.300
Yeah.

35:42.600 --> 35:44.105
Maybe you will die.

35:47.200 --> 35:49.185
Xu Xiao killed so many people.

35:49.900 --> 35:51.545
Why does he keep me alive?

35:52.075 --> 35:53.401
The Princess of Chu's life
is still quite useful

35:53.425 --> 35:55.675
at the crucial moment.

35:56.500 --> 35:57.665
He wants to kill you?

35:57.925 --> 35:59.105
Not to kill me,

35:59.225 --> 36:01.145
but to change my life for something.

36:03.875 --> 36:04.875
Where's Jiang Ni?

36:07.350 --> 36:08.500
Where are you from?

36:18.350 --> 36:20.276
You have to do something about it.

36:20.300 --> 36:21.850
I'm reading now.

36:22.000 --> 36:23.676
What's the use of reading?

36:23.700 --> 36:25.521
Can you acquire martial arts
in such a short time?

36:25.545 --> 36:27.065
I charge for reading.

36:27.400 --> 36:30.465
I can get seven strings of pennies
after I read this book.

36:30.525 --> 36:32.041
How can you still
think about making money

36:32.065 --> 36:33.745
at this time?

36:34.550 --> 36:35.625
You know

36:35.975 --> 36:38.345
the funeral custom in Chu
is complicated.

36:38.525 --> 36:40.475
A funeral will cost a lot.

36:41.850 --> 36:43.305
I've been thinking

36:43.700 --> 36:45.401
that I have no relatives and no family,

36:45.425 --> 36:46.975
and my state fell.

36:48.100 --> 36:49.185
If I don't even

36:49.300 --> 36:51.241
have a funeral after I die,

36:51.265 --> 36:52.545
won't it be too pitiful?

36:54.450 --> 36:56.545
You want to make money

36:56.775 --> 36:57.482
to...

36:57.506 --> 36:58.945
To hold myself a funeral.

37:05.300 --> 37:07.825
But why are you
trying to kill Xu Fengnian?

37:08.500 --> 37:09.825
You hate the Xu family?

37:10.550 --> 37:11.550
No.

37:12.975 --> 37:14.575
What else could it be?

37:17.225 --> 37:18.375
Because...

37:18.850 --> 37:20.050
His Highness wants to see you.

37:21.125 --> 37:22.425
It's finally time to read.

37:22.775 --> 37:24.135
I'll go with you.

37:24.225 --> 37:25.625
He only wants to see Jiang Ni.

37:32.075 --> 37:33.975
I put my money box in the tent.

37:34.225 --> 37:35.785
I'll guard it for you.

37:45.000 --> 37:46.000
Do you need me to read?

37:46.125 --> 37:47.125
Yes.

37:49.325 --> 37:50.325
Not this one.

37:50.350 --> 37:51.426
Get those books in the carriage.

37:51.450 --> 37:53.325
But I've been reading it for days.

37:53.850 --> 37:55.750
It doesn't count
if you didn't read it to me.

37:55.925 --> 37:57.001
One penny for each word.

37:57.025 --> 37:58.345
I'll pay you after you finish it.

38:07.025 --> 38:08.665
Don't you think it smells bad?

38:09.825 --> 38:10.545
Yes.

38:10.700 --> 38:12.826
I'm kind of uncomfortable
after staying in the carriage all day.

38:12.850 --> 38:14.441
There is hot water by the bonfire.

38:14.465 --> 38:15.945
Wash your hands and feet by yourself.

38:16.100 --> 38:17.100
Me?

38:17.125 --> 38:18.565
Don't come back until you are clean!

38:23.825 --> 38:24.825
Which one?

38:29.075 --> 38:30.225
Read this one first.

38:30.250 --> 38:31.275
Compendium of Swords.

38:34.625 --> 38:37.121
(The Prologue of Compendium of Swords)
Sword is the head of all weapons.

38:37.145 --> 38:38.465
It's made to kill.

38:38.550 --> 38:40.065
At the beginning of everything,

38:40.125 --> 38:41.665
there was gold falling from the sky.

38:41.875 --> 38:43.400
An ancient immortal got it

38:43.775 --> 38:45.265
and refined it into steel.

38:45.600 --> 38:47.185
That was the first sword in the world.

38:47.650 --> 38:50.050
It was the gathering of water and fire,

38:50.200 --> 38:51.985
the mixture of Yin and Yang,

38:52.250 --> 38:54.065
somewhere in between
rigidity and softness.

38:54.350 --> 38:55.945
Divide the mountains with strength.

38:56.225 --> 38:58.065
Heaven and earth perished.

38:58.450 --> 39:01.161
The sword works by impaling bodies.

39:01.185 --> 39:03.665
The so-called Dancing Sleeves
Whisking the Pear Blossoms,

39:03.800 --> 39:05.385
the Flying Snow,

39:05.500 --> 39:07.105
the Fleeing Time,

39:07.225 --> 39:09.475
the Horse Back,

39:10.050 --> 39:12.225
are all the manifestations
of the skills.

39:12.350 --> 39:14.105
The skills can be taught easily,

39:14.225 --> 39:15.905
but the art of martial arts
is unspeakable.

39:17.500 --> 39:18.800
10, 15.

39:19.450 --> 39:21.925
20, 25.

39:22.375 --> 39:23.375
30.

39:23.500 --> 39:24.500
Keep reading.

39:25.125 --> 39:26.645
Let me count how many words I've read.

39:26.775 --> 39:28.101
You can count together after you finish.

39:28.125 --> 39:29.125
55.

39:29.275 --> 39:29.891
60.

39:29.915 --> 39:30.790
65.

39:30.814 --> 39:31.950
70, 75.

39:32.075 --> 39:33.376
80, 85.

39:33.400 --> 39:35.775
90, 95.

39:39.925 --> 39:41.850
100 pennies for 100 words.

39:42.125 --> 39:43.705
There are 97 words.

39:44.100 --> 39:45.681
Where are the three more?

39:45.705 --> 39:47.151
Just three more words!

39:47.175 --> 39:48.241
Why are you so stingy?

39:48.265 --> 39:49.905
I'm the one who pays the money.

39:51.125 --> 39:52.305
Fine, 97!

39:53.175 --> 39:54.265
I'll keep reading.

39:56.750 --> 39:59.425
Being cautious leads to weakness.

39:59.545 --> 40:00.945
The meaning is deep.

40:01.225 --> 40:02.576
The art of martial arts
has different styles

40:02.600 --> 40:04.080
and can be divided into Yin and Yang.

40:04.225 --> 40:05.681
Cultivate the spirit and be righteous.

40:05.705 --> 40:07.226
The internal force will come into being.

40:07.250 --> 40:08.721
Breathe in and breathe out
in a solid way.

40:08.745 --> 40:10.250
There is no boundary.

40:10.500 --> 40:11.900
All crap!

40:13.425 --> 40:14.601
This book can mislead learners.

40:14.625 --> 40:15.785
It's full of absurdity.

40:18.725 --> 40:20.145
Do you know this book?

40:20.225 --> 40:21.481
It's Compendium of Swords.

40:21.505 --> 40:23.500
When Du Sicong wrote this book,

40:23.550 --> 40:25.041
he wanted to put aside the skills

40:25.065 --> 40:26.476
and seek for the art of swordsmanship.

40:26.500 --> 40:28.226
Unfortunately, he was inadequate

40:28.250 --> 40:29.665
and the book is biased.

40:29.750 --> 40:32.281
I scolded him
when he was writing the book.

40:32.305 --> 40:34.065
It's a pity
that he still went the wrong way.

40:35.200 --> 40:37.705
Du Sicong who wrote
the Compendium of Swords

40:38.475 --> 40:39.705
was scolded by you?

40:39.800 --> 40:41.185
He came to me for advice

40:41.250 --> 40:43.251
and stood in the snow
for three days and three nights.

40:43.275 --> 40:44.865
Then I reluctantly

40:45.065 --> 40:46.226
gave him a few words.

40:46.250 --> 40:47.625
Brag as you want.

40:47.775 --> 40:49.385
His Compendium of Swords

40:49.425 --> 40:51.750
was collected in the Arsenal of Liyang.

40:51.925 --> 40:53.776
If you are that good,
you can write one yourself.

40:53.800 --> 40:55.281
I've always been alone.

40:55.305 --> 40:57.265
There are countless ideas in my mind,

40:57.465 --> 40:59.475
but I disdain to write them down.

40:59.700 --> 41:00.681
You are still bragging.

41:00.705 --> 41:02.075
Stop doing it.

41:03.275 --> 41:04.465
I'll keep reading.

41:05.400 --> 41:06.400
Since Senior

41:06.825 --> 41:08.000
said so,

41:09.775 --> 41:11.625
try the Sword Mantra of Killing Whales.

41:14.200 --> 41:15.825
The Sword Mantra of Killing Whales.

41:16.850 --> 41:18.305
Thousands of miles under the sea,

41:18.400 --> 41:20.025
a living beast

41:20.200 --> 41:21.681
rides the tide

41:21.705 --> 41:23.276
with the sound of thunder

41:23.300 --> 41:25.785
and a heart unafraid of the sword.

41:25.850 --> 41:28.345
In spite of the giant waves,

41:28.500 --> 41:30.100
it gets killed
at one slash of the sword.

41:30.425 --> 41:31.641
It's a good idea,

41:31.665 --> 41:33.121
but the mantra is too weak

41:33.145 --> 41:34.401
for such a grand scene.

41:34.425 --> 41:37.000
This book is worse than the last one.

41:38.125 --> 41:38.761
All right.

41:38.785 --> 41:39.900
Let's change another one.

41:40.575 --> 41:41.575
This one.

41:41.900 --> 41:43.841
Jiazi's Sword Practice Records
at Lyushui Pavilion.

41:43.865 --> 41:45.476
It's a swordsmanship brochure
given by Wang Chonglou to me.

41:45.500 --> 41:47.281
It's about the sword techniques.

41:47.305 --> 41:48.881
You haven't mastered Dahuangting.

41:48.905 --> 41:50.545
What's the use of practicing this?

41:51.925 --> 41:53.945
Treatise of the Most Exalted One.

41:54.275 --> 41:56.105
There was something
undefined and complete,

41:56.275 --> 41:58.075
coming into existence
before Heaven and Earth.

41:58.200 --> 42:00.201
How still it was and formless.

42:00.225 --> 42:02.921
The way to use the internal force
resides in the framework of Wudang.

42:02.945 --> 42:05.345
If you want to turn Dahuangting
into your own internal force,

42:05.475 --> 42:07.235
you have to figure out
how to do it yourself.

42:09.625 --> 42:10.825
It makes sense.

42:11.675 --> 42:12.675
Stop reading.

42:14.000 --> 42:15.426
I'll read a different one?

42:15.450 --> 42:16.450
That's it for today.

42:16.700 --> 42:18.745
I just read a few words.

42:19.725 --> 42:20.945
Let me count it.

42:20.975 --> 42:21.975
20.

42:24.050 --> 42:26.150
195 words.

42:27.400 --> 42:29.665
195 pennies.

42:39.300 --> 42:40.375
Smelly old man!

42:40.525 --> 42:41.625
I washed my feet!

42:41.725 --> 42:43.041
You are so talkative!

42:43.065 --> 42:44.625
Otherwise, I could read several books!

42:44.745 --> 42:46.826
You should count how much you owe me!

42:46.850 --> 42:48.275
I don't have any money.

43:29.905 --> 43:32.625
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.400 --> 43:37.200
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.125 --> 43:42.045
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.125 --> 43:46.925
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.225 --> 43:51.125
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.825 --> 43:55.645
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.650 --> 44:00.405
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.425 --> 44:05.350
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.850 --> 44:08.581
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.605 --> 44:09.845
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.625 --> 44:14.485
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.300 --> 44:18.026
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.050 --> 44:19.485
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.975 --> 44:23.850
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.275 --> 44:25.626
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.650 --> 44:28.485
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.900 --> 44:31.381
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.405 --> 44:33.805
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.100 --> 44:36.126
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.150 --> 44:38.326
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.350 --> 44:42.565
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.925 --> 44:44.061
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.085 --> 44:47.125
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.300 --> 44:49.261
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.285 --> 44:52.005
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.565 --> 44:54.381
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.405 --> 44:56.901
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.925 --> 45:01.025
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
